# Git Standards

## Identity

This repo uses local git identity: `tomst <xelos.wot@gmail.com>`. Remote pushes use SSH via `github.com-populum` (personal gaming GitHub account, not business credentials).

## No Cursor attribution

Never include "Made with Cursor", "Built with Cursor", or `Co-authored-by: Cursor` in commits, PR titles, or PR bodies.

## Commit and push policy

- Only commit when explicitly asked
- Never push unless explicitly asked
- Never update global git config from this project

## Commit messages

Short, imperative, focused on why. Match existing style (e.g. "Renata fixes", "Update populum.c5m").
